# KFN: running a program on a zero-padded stream

`padC L0 Q code`: park the `L0` entries of the stream (stack `qP`), push `Q` zeros, unpark;
run `code`; park the first `L0` entries, drop the next `Q`, unpark.

**`sImpl_pad`**: if `code` implements `T` on `np ≥ n` records (strides `st`), the padded program
